{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:479e17f8996f097a0c212cf22bcbf1d129435c29006c5fd6a7ad63e44d63edcd",
      "text": "Come on. It's not like that. It's\njust the only one I had.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:45ffe39ab637dcb5cdec760f0902ab7f044849e3a9341eca0419a1d4b8b85c28",
      "text": "Liar, liar! That coat's so clean.\nAfter ten-plus years of wandering,\nno way.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:61706af6e0b709840c2fbe705166f1482f685fc3c92047fa72f9754dc484eabd",
      "text": "I thought, whoa, you're still\nwearing that. A gift from an\nex-girlfriend, no less—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6ea08b3cf58a4554798b202f4cf532c071d94f892234b3da6c26423adb21ec97",
      "text": "Ah, shut up, shut up! If it's the\nonly thing from home I've got, I'm\ngonna take care of it, okay??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de39433549d11ff4b0af5d7b569547b54fa0eab3d115370fcadbc3d59b9fba1e",
      "text": "Shibuya's right here now. Wanna go\nbuy clothes together?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8b68a658521f25d8745b1792e72d49feb9790d5b0cbad1d8dbf62fdd322dca15",
      "text": "See, bullseye~. And anyway~? Yucko's\nalready, y'know...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3c42273da811897c6d51f88eca84d4ee1c2945bb2fb10b277bd4e15c4157205",
      "text": "...Yeah. She got married. Actually,\nshe had kids.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c21d4508a46fe85487fed8295d11566e9decf31fc7de5f0a21a8e6281d2ba6ad",
      "text": "Hoooooooooo.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:473921d6a9b7a111341e5afe68c5e00da8d65af2a2e3d39d3a806e78e5e648a7",
      "text": "Seriously annoying...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:45a3bc323b4326d8ca8b02a5648a89e61c164234cd72228f0064016af4d84504",
      "text": "...But I see. Nami became a career\nwoman, and Yucko became a mom...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d376f8635ab20077a2a76bd0a052d8644ef1158c8ff00d274afdf0593026806",
      "text": "...Akemi said, you know.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97c74a130377b9baeedd1fede062ffc19ea404ea3a8b811b844cfccfeee23a40",
      "text": "She said you were definitely alive.\nLaughing her head off the whole\ntime, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "53": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:06e6c6cb3adbf55ac05deb5ebdadce8fb590dd6d6d6bcc2b053e9393ecdd7e65",
      "text": "Mom...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:626b74aa1d5ebfcd8a22ce4862c9c29e49bbcd5898af59faf1a3ced5d0fdced6",
      "text": "Oh, and she remarried a guy over\nten years younger.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b23e1be6b2eb478d373fb9c11f7c85f8240d4d4b4a2def7ef0d22bd5763016f5",
      "text": "Mom?!?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2bcd2ba1dd13ecbb599529a2c2cd5de2a32c028770d61f0543203b32ddd5686f",
      "text": "Wooaaaah?! Aaaaah, the\ningredients...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b69a1789bfff89c6516d4c2f65cb45ba384da1aef7d30d999c581952cc7319c7",
      "text": "Oh, rare to see that. It's fine,\nAlk! Let's eat out together for\nonce!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:743a2e942d23c39293a80f37c6bf6ddea98108d550dc1a29b3bac3b9e4dc7ffa",
      "text": "...Western fantasy grub, huh...\nMaybe I'll have a drink after all\nthis time...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:afb4c5259116f23783a316ed75d2a8a8735e1a3c44d59ea45aed96c91d065426",
      "text": "Ugh... It's freezing...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2548c82413d6d616eee286b78c07d446c933588149391a7e23d7f3429711a044",
      "text": "...I finally made the investigation\nteam, and now I'm patrolling against\nextremists... Hire some guards...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b3a8b652c9d188d408258d9dedcf1504c9c88b9c71380043344ff84b259b6f0a",
      "text": "Five years, huh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ec0912ad2e94397b8183c041e8f11fc15b946540df26f58168dd25c8ed5ddb10",
      "text": "......No way...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:974ff1102580fef787560b5af46e7f00345b4bf87cee48b95fa0fec5f804a43a",
      "text": "Wait... Wait!... Please, wait!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2a970894798eb3f4672a14a78185aba791b847092a5bb871b6276c79302dd224",
      "text": "Dad...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83a141fbc4806372fd76afcc873e95d7fc5b4a28407936af91a252eadbca07ce",
      "text": "...Haha. Wow, how long has it been\nsince I had this dream...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a093ffd5aadf08a9e7b9308a75deaea80a150b52455c5cdd25763a42fc893fd1",
      "text": "Ahh, maybe I drank too much.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7c3d54bf2206423e1e84c17771aea5c0ff6cabec19b9dc53bd42dd88c7a77ff0",
      "text": "Now then. Let's find something to\neat—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "112": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4ae30f8dcaad63d116323052676764a6450741fdd33d1593958c79b713b0ea4",
      "text": "Taichi...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5fe55e8e4b729ad89a910a7739620b1157fbf775f396ffd2a1cc6d4fd7e8eb31",
      "text": "Hey. ...You're up late too, huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "120": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c550b90204ad91932485570dc2dd4ebc0ff875742e8e611715a1ebacc34eda58",
      "text": "...Um, shall I make a late-night\nsnack? Something simple.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eec9fc8554c1f1e58821c3147254f97136f354126a9effdf297e7ab859884557",
      "text": "Seriously? You'd do that??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6f5c8fb0ed39e5424edca472258018c834a5909e04c85b8149765bfb7ea379a1",
      "text": "...It's good......",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:758f30ee24a7c87df57291e110724d616be63ab927f30e280f66a59eb21c1bb7",
      "text": "...It's good... No... This...\nSeriously...... It's so good......",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:778bff392eecb5e9e9ca6eb44dbc263dfa4dea482b4d03cd368e05d9d13fe6c7",
      "text": "Wh-what, it's not that big a deal—\nWait, you're crying...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0a55024d0c63e0fce6fe0d903a2173e0a6981d963117ba90204d5fa5fa3ddbd1",
      "text": "No, I mean, this, you... This is\nJapanese-style Western food... Of\ncourse I'm crying.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "144": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5652d70832180a3c92d4ceb726c5a5fd16497e876bcddce3016edfae0ccb545c",
      "text": "...No, that too, but? It's amazing,\ny'know? The seasoning? The heat?\nUgh, damn. I'm short on words...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b76c752d0d2a86911c4ea616baea2e862d5a5a33fcc12c40ca4c76bcbf2809dd",
      "text": "No... seriously, it's so good. I\nlove this.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:405ee3acdab7a8211724fcb3f8ff9c455dfa6a4dd08ca2a74b56c3f2db74f235",
      "text": "Th-thank you...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8261bbd2a0b56848670e4ab76234d60b3660f0cff4024b953fa569e74da1a83b",
      "text": "Haha. You're a real good kid,\naren't you? I'm the one being fed,\nand you're the one who looks happy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cae1ec9ab0d4f1bc1864620518f2ca58e251a80b572a0f25786af62d0c120de1",
      "text": "...I used to date someone like\nthat. She's the one who introduced\nme to Mamiya, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7907f8bae08d8cab72f97df66117c64fa8546bb6fccbb82fd12d3c5520e8f828",
      "text": "...Is that Yucko?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:08017ff142bc8c203d786fe5526687d3a20c3c572e01018f07496005dad682db",
      "text": "Oh? You were listening, huh??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e02ccafe8d24871d2397ae6d4bbdeefcc44a136cef3d7a90f246340e04c29e1f",
      "text": "...She was a great girl. I really\nrespected her. ...If only I hadn't\ndone something stupid.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:afdc2a14d2eb1e2b99a16b55a4edfb777337ba6bbe974bc83bc378c4df02f8e2",
      "text": "I mean, like, cheating? A mistake?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "176": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e2d98cd0cd586c01d0ebcb478b2b66f61572fb526c1deb6f6ea7e92fce4da26d",
      "text": "Wow...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:809b3b1d39c39fec3dc1b4abc1221522131e89726cf46348ab4cda41abb8cbd1",
      "text": "I'll regret it the rest of my life...\n...No, wait! Forget about my mistakes!\nI want to hear about you, Alk!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abb39adbfdab03215b6f67788c42a1cffb67ed4aa8062060785b02034c07dfcc",
      "text": "Got a type? Are older people okay,\nor not?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1813f5151e420074f2ab464b384afff2aecb9330db5cb2610e3864e7a5e8aef3",
      "text": "Well... If you ask me, I like\npeople who eat my food happily.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:79eb1d3d311eb69b57a43c17f686e6085cb45c6098d573fc78776091843ad2f6",
      "text": "......Huh? Wait. Am I being hit on?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:04bf05b663fb8b5ff51e82a6d80d8c26e36b656c8b661e2498bc28a778d72bfe",
      "text": "No, wait, a guy in his forties\ngetting asked about romance. Sorry,\nsorry.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea4e4def799dff68209ff5888b1c5b75945bcfb9e843e74973793531fd697068",
      "text": "I'll be gone before long anyway.\nJust bear with me till then.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1dd60a67092db817d67970d30c44d8531ce69c44fd5a2c88eee36b037730b165",
      "text": "Are you going off on a journey\nagain? Even though Shibuya, your\nhometown, is right here?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a82b5acc0af94772589952a4e9b393a4e905a2a3d7ad48e2059f7cc817059172",
      "text": "Ah...... Well, I haven't actually\nbeen to Shibuya yet...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21476be60cd7b97da049eb0a32a95ae35a13067f6f577596ef033626389726d6",
      "text": "...I'm scared, I guess. That if I\nchase it carelessly, it'll slip\nright through my fingers.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7868f6a2a3b963500cfc39208a91a9b0f698a21f8e1c297a3eac230aca8963a4",
      "text": "It's already lost. Chasing phantoms\ngets you nothing. Can't be helped,\nI keep telling myself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c42afed86c83b33301684fe9109ab10713725ec2754c768fa227ea5c8c7ac6c",
      "text": "My parents haven't come back from\ntheir dream yet, either.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9ccbcb105265de591d5842cf51eb6f9a07ab9e9e9c3a5b1faa60868a5b8c1a34",
      "text": "...It might not be the same, but I\nthink I understand.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "223": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:42a9742accb271148f5ecf36b84bab5ab260261df617dee7157938ab44608902",
      "text": "I see... Thanks.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e01f48c2261dec566208cf3bea95ff9ad3b132d9ad722354ed4ba857fb9683b8",
      "text": "Still... I can't keep running\nforever. I'd at least like to hold\na funeral.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "232": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8b60404dbdef01dbce69017af79b7209b980b6e0cac7d37a2572e7331430e808",
      "text": "......Okay! Then, shall we go\ntogether!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "236": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7a5758fff65d9007fba325cf457d35c334a885a6bbdfda560593f9aa34432508",
      "text": "Huh...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "240": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1ff20c6508e3a69aac0dca95b991e87f3418b700c10892d8ba5bd480552975c",
      "text": "Come on, it's lonely alone, right?\nKeep me company. Alk!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "244": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b519f54341729bc1c0939c45a5dc657a59829b64d78fc546f6f203f93196e440",
      "text": "Is that something a grown man\nshould say...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "249": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:456de695350ec15e5f97e136d73a97df76b9eb5c47469f11bdc99374665c7175",
      "text": "You're dead wrong if you think\ngetting old makes you a proper\nadult!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "252": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a307b2d37eb0c4fbe4e4de2dd4a228d69eb0e36cb573afc2c465590d9be250a7",
      "text": "Don't lump me in with Mamiya, okay?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "256": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6b32717df46dc0c245c0eea0f854010e7adde20b608678122da8d65f3777dc9",
      "text": "You're too honest. ...Understood.\nLet's go together.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
